| Desk2D: V3DRender 0.25's desktop copies and fills (window moves,
| scrolls, plain rectangles) on the GPU. It draws on part of the screen,
| checks the GPU's result against the CPU's, times both and writes
| Results2D here. Run Check first (it loads V3DRender 0.25).
Set V3DCheck$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.25 RMLoad <Obey$Dir>.V3DRender
RMEnsure V3DRender 0.25 Error V3DRender 0.25 didn't load
WimpSlot -min 8000K -max 8000K
Run <Obey$Dir>.Draw2D
